	["DictKey_ActionText_260"] = "Hornet Five-One, Overlord. Check fuel state now. Proceed to tanker to mitigate fuel-driven RTB risk. Texaco One-One, two five two decimal one, TACAN Two-One Yankee, is twenty nautical miles north of your position. Execute.",
