	["DictKey_ActionText_403"] = "Hornet 5-1: Russians don’t usually walk that thing this far north unless they’re paying attention.\n",
	["DictKey_ActionText_404"] = "Hornet 5-1: They know we’re in the neighborhood. We know they’re out there.\n",
