	["DictKey_descriptionText_1"] = "MOTHER\n1) Harry S. Truman (127.500MHz) Chn 11, Link 336.000MHz\n2) George Washington (127.600) Chn 12, 337.000MHz\n\nAWACS\n1) Overlord-1-1 (251.100MHz)\n1) Magic-2-1 (251.200MHz)\n\nTANKERs\n1) Texico-1-1 (252.100MHz) CHN 21Y\n2) Arco-2-1 (252.200MHz) CHN 22Y\n3) Texaco-3-1 (252.300MHz) CHN 23Y\n4) Shell-4-1 (252.400MHz) CHN 24Y\n5) Shell-5-1 (252.500MHz) CHN 25Y\n\nJTACs\n1) Uzi-1 (333.100MHz)\n2) Uzi-2 (333.200MHz) Target: 36 S YD 70463 48222\n3) Pointer-1 (333.300MHz) East (2 Enemy Units)\n4) Eyeball-1 (333,400Mhz) North\n5) Whiplash-1 (333.500MHz) Target: 36 S YE 61583 40738\n\nHOLDING FIX: R-196 DME 25 FL100\n\n*  RedFlag Radio is set to 128.100-900MHz or 266.100-900MHz\n** Coordinates for Mk-84 Unguided Strike: 36 S YE 61583 40738 ALT 47\n",
